$802A b BipodsPictureSpare ; never read
$802B b HelpMenuPicture ; the help menu: the title, seven bars, the woman with the gun, the colour band
> The bars are empty: HelpMenu prints the items into them.
@res pictures/help-menu.hrust
$8C73 b HelpMenuPictureSpare ; never read
$8C74 b FeaturesPicture ; help item 5 "Особенности игры": a map, "Advises"
@res pictures/features.hrust
$904D b FeaturesPictureSpare ; never read
$904E b CreditsPicture ; help item 6 "CREDITZ": a computer and a book
@res pictures/credits.hrust
$9419 b CreditsPictureSpare ; never read
$941A b CannonsPicture ; help item 3, page 5: "ПУШКИ"
@res pictures/cannons.hrust
$97D1 b CannonsPictureSpare ; never read
