$C9EE b DescriptionPage4 ; 4: the craft's shadow and shield, what it can do, the status panel
@res text/description.bin
$CCE7 b DescriptionPage5 ; 5: resources in cosmodollars, the goal
@res text/description.bin
$CE96 b ProductionPage1 ; "Производство роботов" 1: landing on the base, choosing components
@res text/production.bin
$D18F b ProductionPage2 ; 2: taking a component off, what a robot must have, towers
@res text/production.bin
$D488 b ProductionPage3 ; 3: cheap robots, 'ВЫПУСК' and 'ВЫХОД', releasing three
